==Battleground==
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ryu (Enemy)|Ryu]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Zangief (Enemy)|Zangief]] spawns.
**1 [[Blanka (Enemy)|Blanka]] spawns.

==Strategy==
General meatshielding and long range attacks will be able to defeat this level with fair ease. Stuff like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] have enough range to slowly chip all of the enemies down.

